An original realistic tactical first-person shooter.

## Game Information
- Genre: Tactical FPS
- Engine: Unreal Engine 5
- Platforms: Android, iOS, PC
- Game Mode: 5v5 Multiplayer
- Graphics: Realistic 3D

## Core Features
- First-person combat
- Unique playable operators
- Tactical abilities
- Weapon customization
- Bomb planting and defusing
- Competitive matchmaking
- Ranked mode

## Development Versions
- 0.1: Training prototype
- 0.2: Combat prototype
- 0.3: Multiplayer prototype
- 1.0: Initial release

